# drv8833_stepper (design stepper-s1 D7, D9): its gptimer alarm ISR (CONFIG_GPTIMER_ISR_CACHE_SAFE) and its nFAULT ISR
# run while flash is busy (NVS and OTA writes), and its safe-off hook in a panic with the cache in any state.
# `noflash` puts the object's text in IRAM and its rodata in DRAM, so the inlined ledc_ll, gpio_ll, bridge and motion
# code, and anything the compiler leaves out of line at -Og, stays reachable then (spec 03 §3.4).
[mapping:drv8833_stepper]
archive: libdrv8833_stepper.a
entries:
    drv8833_stepper (noflash)
